// Jest Snapshot v1, https://jestjs.io/docs/snapshot-testing

exports[`asBootDelta given: [case2] one brief changed, one added, one removed when: [t0] the delta is computed then: the rendered delta matches snapshot 1`] = `
"# boot drift since this clone spawned

drift = 039a9091f2acce7c

your system prompt holds the boot as it was when you spawned. the boot has changed since.
each block below supersedes the block of the same path in your system prompt; a block
listed as removed no longer boots. asked which boot drift you hold, name the drift above.

## changed

<brief.say path=".agent/repo=.this/role=any/briefs/surf.md">
paddle out at dusk
</brief.say>

## added

<brief.ref path=".agent/repo=.this/role=any/briefs/fins.md"/>

## removed

- brief.ref .agent/repo=.this/role=any/briefs/wax.md
"
`;

exports[`asBootDelta given: [case4] the boot changed only outside every brief block when: [t0] the delta is computed then: the rendered delta matches snapshot 1`] = `
"# boot drift since this clone spawned

drift = 88e39b1e9bf95f56

your system prompt holds the boot as it was when you spawned. the boot has changed since.
each block below supersedes the block of the same path in your system prompt; a block
