## outside the briefs

the boot changed outside any brief, where no block above can carry it. respawn to take it.

\`\`\`
<!-- cache boundary -->
\`\`\`
"
`;

exports[`asBootDelta given: [case7] a boot the size of a real one: ~1,000 blocks, ~500KB when: [t1] every block changed, a drift the size of the boot then: the stub matches snapshot 1`] = `
"# boot drift since this clone spawned

drift = f4b9420c8857088c

the boot has changed since you spawned, by 13009 lines, past the 2000 line cap a compaction carries.
so no block is carried here: respawn to take the current boot, which loads whole from the shared cache.
"
`;
